TEXT 32 0 Left 3 ;UNIFIED ANALOG COMMAND-CURRENT SUPERVISOR | REV F | One wired sheet
TEXT 32 2720 Left 3 ;HC logic confirmed. Coil assumption: 30 ohm + 100 mH. RF1 models fuse continuity only.
TEXT 32 2760 Left 3 ;0.5s ON | 1.5s OPEN | 2.2s RESTORE | 2.5s OFF | 3s ON | 3.5s LOW TEST | 3.9s HIGH TEST | 4.3s RESTORE | 4.6s OFF | 5s STUCK | 5.8s RESTORE
TEXT 32 2800 Left 3 ;Single labels identify probe points only. Every repeated connection uses a wire. No hierarchical sheets.
TEXT 32 2840 Left 3 ;Models: LM358 approximation / TI LM339-family; functional HC, regulator, switch, MOSFET and buzzer approximations. See README.
TEXT 32 2912 Left 2 !.include UnifiedSupervisor20261028.lib\n.param Rcoil=30 Lcoil=100m\n.tran 0 6.4 0 500u\n.options plotwinsize=0 reltol=.003 method=gear\n.save V(V12) V(V5) V(C) V(D) V(GATE) V(DRAIN) V(SHUNT) V(AMP) V(I_FILT) V(DELAY_RC) V(LOW) V(HIGH) V(PRESENT) V(NORMAL) V(FU) V(FO) V(FS) V(FAULT) I(L1) I(RS) I(R19) I(R15) I(R16) I(R17) I(R18) V(BUZ_LO)\n.meas TRAN Coil_Normal AVG I(L1) FROM=1 TO=1.4\n.meas TRAN Sense_Normal AVG V(I_FILT) FROM=1 TO=1.4\n.meas TRAN V5_Min MIN V(V5)\n.meas TRAN Delay_Rise TRIG V(C) VAL=2.5 RISE=1 TARG V(D) VAL=2.5 RISE=1\n.meas TRAN Open_Under AVG V(FU) FROM=1.8 TO=2.1\n.meas TRAN LowTest_Under AVG V(FU) FROM=3.7 TO=3.85\n.meas TRAN HighTest_Over AVG V(FO) FROM=4.05 TO=4.2\n.meas TRAN HighTest_Coil AVG I(L1) FROM=4.05 TO=4.2\n.meas TRAN Stuck_Fault AVG V(FS) FROM=5.2 TO=5.6\n.meas TRAN Idle_Fault MAX V(FAULT) FROM=.1 TO=.4\n.meas TRAN Normal_Fault MAX V(FAULT) FROM=.7 TO=1.4\n.meas TRAN Turnoff_Fault MAX V(FAULT) FROM=2.5 TO=2.9
